# FIXED, DEFECT 2208, 2026-10-25, M-rechecked-issues (its second site).
#
# SYMPTOM: a header clang refuses on its own, named by a group here and by
# one in `fixedbugs2208/opened`, was told `ffi_header_refused` once, at the
# first group of the program, the second module's group silent.
#
# CAUSE: whose header a file is was asked of the whole program, the first
# group naming it (`cli/group_file.hero`'s `group_of`), though clang names
# the unit it compiled at the head of its stack.
#
# FIX: the group is asked first among the declarations of the module whose
# unit clang compiled (`group_file.unit_group`), so each unit's refusal is
# told at its own group, defect 2143 having every refused unit read.
use fixedbugs2208/opened

extern "fixedbugs-2143-open-attribute.h"  #~ ffi_header_refused
    constant K_ONE: i64

function main()
    print(K_ONE + opened.one())
